# The Go workspace that lets this repo be built against a local agentlaunch
# checkout instead of the tagged module. Committing it would make CI resolve
# a sibling module from a path that does not exist there — the same failure a
# committed `replace` directive causes, green locally and broken in CI.
/go.work
/go.work.sum

# Model-written code reviews are untracked scratch — the tracked record is the
# triage under docs/superpowers/specs/, which says which claims survived
# verification and why. One of these was committed by accident during the
# agentlaunch extraction (a66be4d) and removed again; this stops the next one.
/review-*.md
